---
import "../styles/approach.css";
import { uiIcon } from "../site/identity";
import Closing from "../components/sections/Closing.astro";

import Layout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Intro from "../components/Intro.astro";
import Chapter from "../components/Chapter.astro";
import Faq from "../components/Faq.astro";
---

<Layout title="Our approach to financial coaching" active="approach">
  <Intro
    eyebrow={"OUR APPROACH"}
    description={
      "A clear introduction, a conversation about fit, and an agreed direction before the work begins."
    }
  >
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Start with where you are.
      <br /> <em>Build from there.</em>
    </Fragment>
  </Intro>
  <nav class="wrap process-overview" aria-label="The three steps">
    {[
      [
        "introduction",
        "01",
        "Introduce yourself",
        "Share your priorities",
        "person",
      ],
      [
        "conversation",
        "02",
        "Explore the fit",
        "Ask your questions",
        "conversation",
      ],
      [
        "direction",
        "03",
        "Agree on a direction",
        "Clarify scope and next steps",
        "compass",
      ],
    ].map(([id, number, title, description, icon]) => (
      <a href={`#${id}`}>
        <span class="process-number">{number}</span>
        <span>
          <strong>{title}</strong>
          <small>{description}</small>
        </span>
        <Fragment set:html={uiIcon(icon)} />
      </a>
    ))}
  </nav>
  <Chapter id="introduction" label={"01 / YOUR INTRODUCTION"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Tell Matt what
      <br /> you want to change.
    </Fragment>
    <p class="lead">
      A first message doesn’t need to tell your whole financial story.
    </p>
    <p>
      Share who the coaching is for, the challenge or goal on your mind, and how
      you prefer to connect. Add context if it helps; estimates and incomplete
      plans are welcome.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Choose budgeting, debt, goals, or several areas.</li>
      <li>Describe what would make a difference to you.</li>
      <li>Include your timing and availability if you know them.</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">
      Open the introduction form
    </a>
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter id="conversation" label={"02 / THE FIRST CONVERSATION"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Understand the situation.
      <br /> Explore the fit.
    </Fragment>
    <p>
      Use the conversation to put your priorities in context and ask questions
      about coaching. Matt can discuss how Afin’s services relate to what you
      need.
    </p>
    <h3>Questions worth bringing</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Where would it make sense to start?</li>
      <li>What would working together involve?</li>
      <li>How would the scope and fees be agreed?</li>
      <li>What information would be useful for the next step?</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      An inquiry opens this conversation; it does not book an appointment or
      begin a paid engagement.
    </p>
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter id="direction" label={"03 / AGREEING ON A DIRECTION"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Know the next step
      <br /> before taking it.
    </Fragment>
    <p class="lead">The plan should reflect the priorities you’ve discussed.</p>
    <p>
      Before work begins, agree with Matt on the scope, fees, and next steps.
      Budgeting, debt payoff planning, and goal-focused guidance may play
      different roles depending on your circumstances.
    </p>
    <h3>Leave with a shared understanding</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>The priorities and scope you agree on.</li>
      <li>Fees and what happens before work starts.</li>
      <li>What to prepare and how to stay in contact.</li>
    </ul>
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter label={"PREPARING WITHOUT OVERTHINKING"}>
    <Fragment slot="title">
      Three things
      <br /> to reflect on.
    </Fragment>
    <div class="reading-cards">
      <article>
        <h3>What feels difficult?</h3>
        <p>
          Name one part of managing money that takes more energy than you would
          like.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>What matters most?</h3>
        <p>
          Think about the change you want your financial decisions to support.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>What would progress feel like?</h3>
        <p>
          A more useful budget or a clearer debt plan is a concrete place to
          begin.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Chapter>
  <Faq
    items={[
      [
        "Should I upload financial documents?",
        "No. The introductory form has no document upload. Leave out account numbers, passwords, Social Security numbers, and financial documents.",
      ],
      [
        "What happens when I use the form?",
        "The page tells you whether it will send directly or prepare an email draft. If it prepares a draft, you still need to send it from your email app. Only a confirmed direct submission means the inquiry has been delivered.",
      ],
      [
        "Can I contact Matt without the form?",
        "Yes. Email madamou@afin-consulting.com or call (203) 770-6522. Share a brief introduction and your preferred way to connect.",
      ],
    ]}
  />
  <Closing />
</Layout>
